{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-85867-r4595351","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Cabbage Rolls in Tomato Sauce (Holubtsi)","sourcePageId":85867,"sourceRevision":"4595351","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-31T19:01:44Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Cabbage%20Rolls%20in%20Tomato%20Sauce%20(Holubtsi)&oldid=4595351","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:08.141Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baked recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using cabbage","Category:Recipes using cornstarch","Category:Recipes using cow milk","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using ground beef","Category:Recipes using rice","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Ukrainian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"587a51bb74efa9bee77140ba392445af3b7cab17b62d43ec0a921823f4b2a5c5","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cabbage recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 12 [[Cookbook:Cabbage|cabbage]] leaves\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] chopped [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Milk|milk]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] (about 500 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) ground [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]]\n* ¾ cup cooked [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n\n=== Sauce ===\n* 1 can [[Cookbook:Tomato Paste|tomato paste]]\n* 1 can chopped [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]]\n* ½ cup water\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 3 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 2 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Cornstarch|cornstarch]] mixed with ½ cup cold water\n\n==Procedure==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 350°F (175°C).\n# Put cabbage into pot of boiling water, cover, let sit for three minutes, then drain.\n# Combine ground beef, milk, egg, rice, onion, pepper, and salt. Divide into twelve portions.\n# Place 1 meat portion on each cabbage leaf.\n# Roll leaf around filling and fasten with [[Cookbook:Toothpick|toothpick]].\n# Place the rolls in a [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|baking dish]].\n# Combine tomato paste, tomatoes, sugar, water, and vinegar, then pour over cabbage rolls.\n# Cover baking dish, and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] at 350°F (175C) for 40 minutes.\n# Remove cabbage rolls from pan, and take out toothpicks. Place on the serving dish\n# Add cornstarch and water to sauce mixture and stir together. Warm, if needed, to allow the cornstarch mixture to thicken the sauce.\n# Pour the completed sauce over the rolls on the serving dish.\n# Garnish as desired and serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using cabbage]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Ukrainian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornstarch]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cow milk]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Cabbage Rolls in Tomato Sauce (Holubtsi)","nameAr":null,"s